{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A pattern names the goals under a folder, from the folder of the goal whose step names it (as a plang path does):\n\"each goal in api/*\" runs for the two goals in the api/ folder beside this one and not for the one outside it.",
  "step": [
    {
